    "studentFacingPrompts": [
      "> What do you notice? What do you wonder? Attribution: Garbage truck, Ave B, by Salim Virji. CC BY-SA 2.0. Creative Commons. Source .",
      "> Find at least 5 different ways to arrange 60 containers. Represent each arrangement with an expression. Create a visual display to show which is the best arrangement for shipping the 3,300 tons of garbage.",
      "> How many containers are on the cargo ship? Record an estimate that is: too low about right too high \\(\\phantom{\\hspace{2.2cm} \\\\ \\hspace{2.2cm}}\\) \\(\\phantom{\\hspace{2.2cm} \\\\ \\hspace{2.2cm}}\\) \\(\\phantom{\\hspace{2.2cm} \\\\ \\hspace{2.2cm}}\\) How many containers are on the cargo ship? Record an estimate that is: too low about right too high \\(\\phantom{\\hspace{2.2cm} \\\\ \\hspace{2.2cm}}\\) \\(\\phantom{\\hspace{2.2cm} \\\\ \\hspace{2.2cm}}\\) \\(\\phantom{\\hspace{2.2cm} \\\\ \\hspace{2.2cm}}\\) What assumptions were you making when you came up with your estimates?"
    ]
  },
  "exactSourceTasks": [
    "Five distinct arrangements of 60 model shipping containers",
    "Low/about-right/high cargo ship image estimates before and after new visual information",
    "Discuss assumptions and challenge unjustified exact estimates"
  ],
